# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
# EN: Preserve private evidence and unlisted originals; track only manifest-owned artwork, but ship no ArtSource.
# 中：保留私有证据及未列原画；只跟踪清单明示的自有美术，玩家包不含 ArtSource。
/.references/
/ArtSource/**
/Release/
/.build/
/Build/Archive/

# EN: Publish reader guides and canonical specs/models; keep process records and retired root paths local.
# 中：仅公开读者指南与权威规格／模型；过程记录和已迁出的旧根路径保留本地。
/PROJECT.md
/ASSETS.md
/CHANGELOG.md
/CHANGELOG.zh-CN.md
/Docs/**
!/Docs/ASSETS.md
!/Docs/CHANGELOG.md
!/Docs/CHANGELOG.zh-CN.md
!/Docs/DEVELOPMENT.md
!/Docs/MECHANICS.md
!/Docs/WORKSHOP.md
/openspec/**
!/openspec/README.md
!/openspec/config.yaml
!/openspec/specs/
!/openspec/specs/**
!/openspec/models/
!/openspec/models/cabinet-model.md

# EN: Game/dependency/build binaries and intermediate outputs are local artifacts.
# 中：游戏、前置与编译二进制及中间产物只留本地。
*.dll
*.pdb
*.cache
*.log
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# EN: Local reference launchers and IDE/user settings may contain personal paths.
# 中：本地引用入口及IDE/用户配置可能含私人路径。
*.local.ps1
*.local.json
*.user
*.suo
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# EN: Derived Git exceptions from ArtSource/distribution-manifest.json; that manifest is authoritative.
